    "host_prepare_tests": "The existing admission regression now checks unconditional no-write Pi consumption and pre-I/O rejection of the retired option. The two distinct receipt aggregation tests moved into this existing test file without changing their assertions; supplied receipt aggregation remains a defensive host boundary, not a modeled current SDK write.",
